  "order": 3,
  "title": "Where are you from?",
  "goal": "Say your nationality and your home town, and ask someone where they are from.",
  "points": ["gp-nationality-words", "gp-harmony-rounding", "gp-copula-present"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "Nationality words are lowercase nouns: *Men türkmen* (I'm Turkmen), *Ol iňlis* (she's English). To ask where someone is from, say *Siz nireli?* Answer with your town and `-lY`: *-ly* after a back vowel, *-li* after a front one: *Men Aşgabatly*, *Ol Tejenli*.",
    "see": "gp-nationality-words"
  },
